<div id='widget_6915_13460_9471' class='content_area normal_content_area clearfix  '><p style="text-align: left;">Use the options below to learn how to obtain certified or informational birth and death certificates from Kern County Public Health.&nbsp;</p></div>
            <!--!!WidgetEnd-->

    <!--!!WidgetStart, vi-orderdata="0"  vi-hideonmobile="false" vi-widgetinstancedata="6921"WidgetStart!!-->    








<div aria-label="Accordion" class=" content_area clearfix" id="widget_6921_13461_9471" role="region"><div class="accordion_widget mn-accordion"><div class='accordion-item' id='BirthCertificates' data-index='1'><div class='accordion-heading' tabindex='0' aria-expanded='true' role='button'><div class='title'>Birth Certificates</div><div class='icon'><i class='arrow right' role='presentation'></i></div></div>
<div class='accordion-content' aria-hidden='true' visibility='hidden'><div class='inner-content'><h2 style="text-indent: -100000px; position:absolute; top:auto; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden;">Order a Birth Certificate</h2>
<h3>Eligibility&nbsp;</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The birth must have occurred in Kern County.</li>
    <li>The birth must have occurred after 1964.</li>
    <li>For births before 1965, contact the Kern County Recorder’s Office</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fees</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>$31.00 per copy</strong> for both certified or informational certificates</li>
</ul>
<h3>&nbsp;How to Request a Birth Certificate</h3>
<h4>1. By Mail</h4>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin: 15px 0;">
<!-- First Image and Links -->
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;">
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14121/639034741855530000" target="_blank">
<img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17826/639034764966530000" alt="Birth Certificate Preview - English" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14121/639034741855530000" target="_blank">English (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Second Image and Links -->
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;">
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14123/639034754023270000" target="_blank">
<img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17834/639034768786930000" alt="Death Certificate Preview - Spanish" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14123/639034754023270000" target="_blank">Spanish (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Application must be notarized.</em></p>
<p>Mail your:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
    <li>Completed Application for Birth Certificate</li>
    <li>Check or money order (no cash) </li>
    <li>Self-addressed stamped envelope</li>
</ul>
<p>To:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong>Kern County Public Health</strong><br>
Attn: Office of Vital Records<br>
1800 Mt Vernon Ave, 1st Floor<br>
Bakersfield, CA 93306-3302</p>
<h4>2. In Person</h4>
<p>Monday – Friday, 8:00 A.M. – 5:00 P.M. (excluding holidays)<br>
Visit:<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; Kern County Public Health<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; 1800 Mt. Vernon Ave, 1st Floor<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; Bakersfield, CA 93306-3302<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; (661) 321-3000</p>
<h4>3. Online</h4>
<p>Order securely through <a href="https://www.vitalchek.com/v/?ScenarioName=AdEospNT" target="_blank">VitalChek</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Additional Resources</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Born in another California county&nbsp;
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/programs/chsi/pages/vital-records.aspx" target="_blank">California State Office of Vital Records</a></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Born outside California&nbsp;
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/?splash=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fnchs%2fnvss%2findex.htm&____isexternal=true" target="_blank">Center for Health Statistics - Nationwide Vital Records</a></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul></div></div></div>
<div class='accordion-item' id='DeathCertificates' data-index='2'><div class='accordion-heading' tabindex='0' aria-expanded='true' role='button'><div class='title'>Death Certificates</div><div class='icon'><i class='arrow right' role='presentation'></i></div></div>
<div class='accordion-content' aria-hidden='true' visibility='hidden'><div class='inner-content'><h2 style="text-indent: -100000px; position:absolute; top:auto; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden;">Order a Birth Certificate</h2>
<h3>Eligibility&nbsp;</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The death must have occurred in Kern County.</li>
    <li>The death must have occurred after 1992.</li>
    <li>For deaths before 1993, contact the Kern County Recorder’s Office.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fees</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>$26.00 per copy</strong>&nbsp;(certified or informational death certificate)&nbsp;</li>
    <li><strong style="font-size: 1.25rem;">$23.00 per copy</strong><span style="font-size: 1.25rem;">&nbsp;(certified or informational <strong>fetal</strong> death certificate)</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>&nbsp;How to Request a Death Certificate</h3>
<h4>1. By Mail - General Public</h4>
<p>Complete the Death Certificate Request</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin: 15px 0;">
<!-- First Image and Links -->
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;">
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14127/639034755998970000" target="_blank">
<img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17828/639034772819570000" alt="Death Certificate Request Preview - English" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14127/639034755998970000" target="_blank">English (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Second Image and Links -->
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;">
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14129/639034757100330000" target="_blank">
<img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17836/639034774181470000" alt="Death Certificate Preview - Spanish" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14129/639034757100330000" target="_blank">Spanish (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Application must be notarized.</em></p>
<p>Mail your:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
    <li>Completed Application for Birth Certificate</li>
    <li>Check or money order (no cash) </li>
    <li>Self-addressed stamped envelope</li>
</ul>
<p>To:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong>Kern County Public Health</strong><br>
Attn: Office of Vital Records<br>
1800 Mt Vernon Ave, 1st Floor<br>
Bakersfield, CA 93306-3302</p>
<h4>2. By Mail - Funeral Establishments</h4>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin: 15px 0;">
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;"><a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14125/638512091175370000" target="_blank"><img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17832/638826465863300000" alt="Death Certificate Request Preview - English" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14125/638512091175370000" target="_blank">Credit Card Authorization Form (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Second Image and Links -->
<div style="text-align: center; flex: 1 1 350px; max-width: 350px;">
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14131/639122685873670000" target="_blank">
<img src="/home/showpublishedimage/17830/639034775010870000" alt="Death Certificate Preview - Spanish" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; height: auto;">
</a>
<div>
<a href="/home/showpublisheddocument/14131/639122685873670000" target="_blank">Funeral Establishment Death Certificate Request (PDF)</a><br>
<br>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Mail both forms along with payment and self-addressed stamped envelope to the address above.&nbsp;</p>
<h4>3. In Person</h4>
<p>Monday – Friday, 8:00 A.M. – 5:00 P.M. (excluding holidays)<br>
Visit:<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; Kern County Public Health<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; 1800 Mt. Vernon Ave, 1st Floor<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; Bakersfield, CA 93306-3302<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; (661) 321-3000</p>
<h4>4. Online</h4>
<p>Order securely through <a href="https://www.vitalchek.com/v/?ScenarioName=AdEospNT" target="_blank">VitalChek</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Additional Resources</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Death occured in another California county&nbsp;
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/programs/chsi/pages/vital-records.aspx" target="_blank">California State Office of Vital Records</a></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Death occured outside California&nbsp;
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/?splash=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fnchs%2fnvss%2findex.htm&____isexternal=true" target="_blank">Center for Health Statistics - Nationwide Vital Records</a></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul></div></div></div>
<div class='accordion-item' id='NatalityData' data-index='3'><div class='accordion-heading' tabindex='0' aria-expanded='true' role='button'><div class='title'>Natality Data</div><div class='icon'><i class='arrow right' role='presentation'></i></div></div>
<div class='accordion-content' aria-hidden='true' visibility='hidden'><div class='inner-content'><iframe title="Kern County Mortality Dashboard" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; margin: 0; outline: none;" src="https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiNzJhMGRiZTItYmRlYi00NzViLWJkMWQtMzI2MjhhNGM5MzJlIiwidCI6ImUwZjJlNGI1LTA1MTUtNDAyOC05OWYyLTJlN2E0M2ZlNTM3OSJ9" allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0">Your browser does not support inline frames.<br />
